    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Sam, au ch\u00f4mage et pom-pom girl \u00e0 ses heures, se bat pour conserver la garde de sa jeune soeur et pour arrondir les fins de mois difficiles. Avec C\u00e9line, sa colocataire et meilleure amie, elles imaginent toutes les solutions pour s\u2019en sortir \u2013 du t\u00e9l\u00e9phone rose \u00e0 l\u2019art floral \u2013jusqu\u2019au jour o\u00f9 un couple inattendu vient sonner \u00e0 leur porte\u2026",
        "english": "Sam, unemployed and an occasional pom-pom girl, fights to have custody of her younger sister and to make ends meet. With C\u00e9line, her room mate and best friend, she imagines all sorts of solutions to their difficult situation \u2013 from phone sex to floral art \u2013 until the day that a couple they don't know knocks on their door."
